# Defect 248 (panel 189's ffi-pragmatist, 2026-10-04), its surface case (lane
# b14-harness-b, 2026-10-07, defect 328's remedy): a header clang warns of,
# bound for one constant. The warning is told once, by the program's own
# unit, where it was told a second time naming the pointee probe's file under
# `build/`, which the author never wrote.
extern "lib.h"
    constant ANSWER: i64

function main()
    print(ANSWER)
